unstructured information, including

3685
06:19:40,006 --> 06:19:43,826
printed natural language texts, and converting it

3686
06:19:43,906 --> 06:19:47,086
into fair digital formats. Findable,

3687
06:19:47,626 --> 06:19:50,846
accessible, interoperable, and reusable.

3688
06:19:51,626 --> 06:19:54,986
This isn't just digitization. It's making data

3689
06:19:55,106 --> 06:19:58,066
actionable for research and conservation.

