3894
06:31:43,738 --> 06:31:47,638
So, just a short introduction. Camera Trap DB standard is a

3895
06:31:47,698 --> 06:31:51,578
standard for exchange of camera trapping data in accordance with the FAIR

3896
06:31:51,658 --> 06:31:52,178
principles.

3897
06:31:53,458 --> 06:31:56,218
