07:13:46,750 --> 07:13:49,110
We have seen a lot of examples of LLM annotation.

4623
07:13:50,490 --> 07:13:53,830
I will just say briefly that I would love to talk to people who are struggling with

4624
07:13:53,890 --> 07:13:57,790
that because I have found some ways that do work effectively to ground

4625
07:13:57,950 --> 07:14:01,590
answers in ontologies and to avoid hallucinating identifiers.

4626
07:14:02,510 --> 07:14:04,370
So we can definitely talk about that after.

4627
07:14:05,230 --> 07:14:08,630
But those are the limitations. That's the repo. That's my email.

4628
07:14:09,430 --> 07:14:12,750
Really interested in collaborating and talking more about this. Thank you.

4629
07:14:16,070 --> 07:14:17,370
Great talk. That was awesome.

4630
07:14:17,630 --> 07:14:17,810
Great.

4631
07:14:18,230 --> 07:14:20,490
Thanks a lot for that talk. Hey, Dave, I'm going to pass this over to you for

4632
07:14:20,530 --> 07:14:20,630
