4635
07:14:33,354 --> 07:14:34,234
I have two questions.

4636
07:14:35,834 --> 07:14:39,234
The first one is, it's only the causality relation.

4637
07:14:39,294 --> 07:14:41,994
You don't have any subtypes of causality.

4638
07:14:44,314 --> 07:14:45,154
What do you mean by that?

4639
07:14:46,054 --> 07:14:48,594
You can have necessary causation.

4640
07:14:48,954 --> 07:14:52,034
So, a cause might be present for the effect to happen, but it does not trigger the

4641
07:14:52,054 --> 07:14:52,834
effect on its own.

4642
07:14:53,214 --> 07:14:53,334
Yep.

4643
07:14:54,454 --> 07:14:57,434
Or you can have the necessary sufficient causation, or you can have

4644
07:14:59,054 --> 07:15:02,674
the type of causation versus what's called token causation-

4645
07:15:03,374 --> 07:15:03,394
Yeah

4646
